ff8bdae4-1f13-4f0b-93b2-2de7face2171 submission: {"title":"Crown Opening Statement","text":"Members of the jury, the Crown bears the burden of proving the supplied fictional condition — that Fictional Ellis received the sealed envelope from Fictional Rowan — beyond a reasonable doubt. E-001 records Mira stating: \"I saw Fictional Rowan hand the sealed envelope to Fictional Ellis. I do not know what the envelope contained.\" Mira describes that handover; E-001 does not establish contents or guilt. No knowing-participation element is supplied. The Crown will present only Mira's approved passages, as permitted."}
7510c836-da60-4845-be00-d47b0aa2c2a9 submission: {"title":"Defence Opening Statement","text":"Members of the jury, the Defence agrees with the Crown on the source limits. E-001 records Mira stating: \"I saw Fictional Rowan hand the sealed envelope to Fictional Ellis. I do not know what the envelope contained.\" That account describes a handover and records uncertainty about contents. E-001 is limited to attributing Mira's account; it does not prove contents or guilt. No knowing-participation element is supplied. The Crown must prove the supplied fictional condition beyond a reasonable doubt."}
