145ba2df-b331-496a-9336-a84a8bdecf1a testimony: {"type":"answer","witnessId":"w1","text":"Yes. As recorded in E-001, my account states: \"I saw Fictional Rowan hand the sealed envelope to Fictional Ellis. I do not know what the envelope contained.\"","sourceRefs":[{"evidenceId":"0e464be2-82b2-4ee6-a850-abf898be5abb","exhibitId":"E-001","attribution":"source"}],"questionEventId":"f92e5a85-e9e3-458d-abe4-afb53a318428","examination":"direct"}
