3350b080-4fae-4bba-87f3-6a6dfdbf2a41 testimony: {"type":"answer","witnessId":"w1","text":"As recorded in E-001, my approved account states: \"I do not know what the envelope contained.\" That is the full extent of what my approved account says on that point.","sourceRefs":[{"evidenceId":"0e464be2-82b2-4ee6-a850-abf898be5abb","exhibitId":"E-001","attribution":"source"}],"questionEventId":"06be8421-f8c3-475d-84c6-b280d0fca20d","examination":"direct"}
