8136459f-c155-4dc1-99a4-07ab7175cfe8 testimony: {"type":"answer","witnessId":"w1","text":"My approved account in E-001 states: \"I saw Fictional Rowan hand the sealed envelope to Fictional Ellis. I do not know what the envelope contained.\" On the question of contents, that is the full extent of what my account says — it does not identify what the envelope contained, and it does not say anything further on that point.","sourceRefs":[{"evidenceId":"0e464be2-82b2-4ee6-a850-abf898be5abb","exhibitId":"E-001","attribution":"source"}],"questionEventId":"589cded9-82de-41c7-9828-cd0c608878e0","examination":"cross"}
c6d4e235-883a-4815-b16e-e1e53f85c3de question: {"type":"question","witnessId":"w1","text":"Fictional Mira, does your approved account in E-001 describe why Fictional Rowan handed the sealed envelope to Fictional Ellis, or identify the purpose of that handover?","examination":"cross"}
746810a3-fea4-4fe4-8d95-3ca2b2aa7e8d testimony: {"type":"answer","witnessId":"w1","text":"My approved account in E-001 does not address the purpose of the handover. It states: \"I saw Fictional Rowan hand the sealed envelope to Fictional Ellis. I do not know what the envelope contained.\" It does not describe why Fictional Rowan handed the envelope to Fictional Ellis, and it does not identify the purpose of that handover. My approved account does not address that point; I cannot add facts outside that account in this exercise.","sourceRefs":[{"evidenceId":"0e464be2-82b2-4ee6-a850-abf898be5abb","exhibitId":"E-001","attribution":"source"}],"questionEventId":"c6d4e235-883a-4815-b16e-e1e53f85c3de","examination":"cross"}
